OL,3,GNEWSAMore than #1m awarded to climate
OL,4,Achange projects
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than #1m has been allocated to
OL,7,Fcommunity projects tackling climate
OL,8,Fchange, including solar panels for an
OL,9,Farts centre, a bike recycling scheme
OL,10,Fand a repair cafe.
OL,12,FSouth Cambridgeshire District Council
OL,13,Fhas awarded money to 110 community
OL,14,Fprojects since the scheme was launched
OL,15,Fin 2019. This year #171,000 is being
OL,16,Fawarded to 14 groups, out of 37
OL,17,Fapplicants.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
