OL,3,GNEWSAMore than #1m awarded to climate
OL,4,Achange projects
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Wysing Arts Centre in Bourn,
OL,7,FCambridgeshire, recently installed 32
OL,8,Fsolar panels, four air source heat
OL,9,Fpumps, electric vehicle charging points
OL,10,Fand a 7,500-litre rainwater harvesting
OL,11,Ftank, part funded by the scheme.
OL,13,FDirector Rosie Cooper said: "I'm
OL,14,Fthrilled to see this project completed
OL,15,Fand already making such a difference."
